== Trivia ==
* In his first [https://youtu.be/kby0rXT7qYQ post-Repentance Lore Stream], Edmund McMillen revealed that the wooden spoon is inspired by the fact that during his childhood his parents would threaten to beat him with a wooden spoon.
** The Wooden Spoon granting a speed up is a nod to the act of running faster to try and escape the abuse.
** In this way, the Wooden Spoon is a counterpart to {{I|The Belt}}, which is also a speed-up item based on a specific object used by McMillen's parents to abuse him.

